{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280100/extras/store_page_banner_00b.png?t=1747501161\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the shoes of our beloved Zookeeper, where chaos reigns supreme and every day is a wild adventure where your fluffy pals are not just cute\u2014they're colossal!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From belly-surfing hippos to tool-attacking rabbits, each day brings new hilarious challenges that will have you laughing out loud and racing against the clock. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you keep the chaos under control and ensure your chubby friends have the time of their lives?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Put on your Zookeeper hat and get your friends\u2014let's get this party started!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280100/extras/store_page_banner_01.png?t=1747501161\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280100/extras/Poster_01.gif?t=1747501161\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Got friends? Great! Now you can all yell at each other while trying to wrangle a virtual hippo. Local AND Remote play? We're enabling your inner zoo-boss from anywhere!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280100/extras/store_page_banner_02.png?t=1747501161\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280100/extras/Poster_02.gif?t=1747501161\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From &quot;Couch Potato Chimp&quot; to &quot;Zoo Tycoon Titan,&quot; pick your poison! Each difficulty has its own progression, so you can start as a clueless newbie and become a zoo-managing mastermind... or just stick with the chimps. No judgement!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280100/extras/store_page_banner_03.png?t=1747501161\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280100/extras/Project_03.gif?t=1747501161\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10 cuddly critters, 40 brain-bending levels, and a to-do list that never ends! Think you can keep a zoo running smoothly? <strong>Spoiler alert</strong>: probably not. But it\u2019ll be hilarious to watch you try!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280100/extras/store_page_banner_04.png?t=1747501161\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280100/extras/Poster_04.gif?t=1747501161\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Think you've mastered the zoo? Think again! Hidden mechanics and bonus objectives are lurking around every corner. Prepare to have your zookeeper mind blown ^^</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3280100?t=1747501161","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280100/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747501161","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280100/7f427a8c6a487852526fd8b8473231e8b9c59d69/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747501161","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280100/7f427a8c6a487852526fd8b8473231e8b9c59d69/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747501161","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280100/extras/store_page_banner_00b.png?t=1747501161\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the shoes of our beloved Zookeeper, where chaos reigns supreme and every day is a wild adventure where your fluffy pals are not just cute\u2014they're colossal!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From belly-surfing hippos to tool-attacking rabbits, each day brings new hilarious challenges that will have you laughing out loud and racing against the clock. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you keep the chaos under control and ensure your chubby friends have the time of their lives?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Put on your Zookeeper hat and get your friends\u2014let's get this party started!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280100/extras/store_page_banner_01.png?t=1747501161\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280100/extras/Poster_01.gif?t=1747501161\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Got friends? Great! Now you can all yell at each other while trying to wrangle a virtual hippo. Local AND Remote play? We're enabling your inner zoo-boss from anywhere!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280100/extras/store_page_banner_02.png?t=1747501161\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280100/extras/Poster_02.gif?t=1747501161\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From &quot;Couch Potato Chimp&quot; to &quot;Zoo Tycoon Titan,&quot; pick your poison! Each difficulty has its own progression, so you can start as a clueless newbie and become a zoo-managing mastermind... or just stick with the chimps. No judgement!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280100/extras/store_page_banner_03.png?t=1747501161\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280100/extras/Project_03.gif?t=1747501161\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10 cuddly critters, 40 brain-bending levels, and a to-do list that never ends! Think you can keep a zoo running smoothly? <strong>Spoiler alert</strong>: probably not. But it\u2019ll be hilarious to watch you try!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280100/extras/store_page_banner_04.png?t=1747501161\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280100/extras/Poster_04.gif?t=1747501161\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Think you've mastered the zoo? Think again! Hidden mechanics and bonus objectives are lurking around every corner. Prepare to have your zookeeper mind blown ^^</p>","developers":["Purple Phobia"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"hea